## Stale Time Guidelines

```typescript
// src/config/query.config.ts
export const STALE_TIMES = {
  REAL_TIME: 0,                // Live data (prices, notifications)
  SHORT: 1000 * 30,            // 30 seconds
  STANDARD: 1000 * 60 * 5,    // 5 minutes (default)
  LONG: 1000 * 60 * 30,       // 30 minutes (static lists)
  PERMANENT: Infinity,         // User preferences, config
} as const;
```

---

## Rules Summary

- ✅ Custom hook wraps every `useQuery` and `useMutation` — never raw in components
- ✅ Services throw `AppError(message, statusCode)` — never generic `Error`
- ✅ Always handle `onError` with `toast.error(getErrorMessage(error))`
- ✅ Always invalidate relevant queries in `onSuccess`
- ✅ Centralize query keys in `src/config/query-keys.ts`
- ✅ Set `staleTime` explicitly on every query
- ❌ Never fetch in `useEffect`
- ❌ Never call `useQuery`/`useMutation` directly in components
- ❌ Never filter or sort data client-side if the API can do it
